{"seq":2,"slug":"property-based-testing","title":"Property-Based Testing 与函数式测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/practice/property-based-testing","wordCount":968,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"property-based-testing-与函数式测试策略\">Property-Based Testing 与函数式测试策略</h1><p>传统单元测试是「举例测试」——开发者手动选几个输入，验证输出是否符合预期。这种方式的覆盖率取决于开发者的想象力，边界条件和极端组合很容易遗漏。Property-Based Testing（PBT, 基于性质的测试）颠覆了这一模式：不指定具体输入，而是声明函数应满足的<strong>不变性质</strong>（property），由测试框架自动生成大量随机输入来验证。纯函数的引用透明性让这一策略特别强大——确定性意味着任何输入都可安全复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PBT 的核心范式转换：测试不再是「给定特定输入 X，期望输出 Y」，而是「对于类型空间中的所有合法输入，以下性质恒成立」。测试框架负责生成大量随机输入来尝试反驳这些性质，失败时自动 shrink 到最小反例。纯函数的确定性保证了每个反例都可精确复现——这是 PBT 在 FP 生态中格外强大的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-example-based-到-property-based\">从 Example-Based 到 Property-Based</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    EB[&quot;Example-Based Testing&quot;]&#10;    PB[&quot;Property-Based Testing&quot;]&#10;    EB --&gt;|&quot;手写 input/output&quot;| Cases[&quot;5-20 个测试用例&quot;]&#10;    PB --&gt;|&quot;声明 property&quot;| Gen[&quot;框架生成 100+ 用例&quot;]&#10;    Gen --&gt; Shrink[&quot;失败时自动缩小反例&quot;]&#10;    Cases --&gt;|&quot;覆盖&quot;| Partial[&quot;部分空间&quot;]&#10;    Gen --&gt;|&quot;覆盖&quot;| Wide[&quot;广泛空间&quot;]\">graph LR\n    EB[\"Example-Based Testing\"]\n    PB[\"Property-Based Testing\"]\n    EB --&gt;|\"手写 input/output\"| Cases[\"5-20 个测试用例\"]\n    PB --&gt;|\"声明 property\"| Gen[\"框架生成 100+ 用例\"]\n    Gen --&gt; Shrink[\"失败时自动缩小反例\"]\n    Cases --&gt;|\"覆盖\"| Partial[\"部分空间\"]\n    Gen --&gt;|\"覆盖\"| Wide[\"广泛空间\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Example-Based</th>\n<th>Property-Based</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入来源</td>\n<td>手动编写</td>\n<td>自动随机生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖范围</td>\n<td>开发者想到的</td>\n<td>类型空间的随机采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界发现</td>\n<td>依赖经验</td>\n<td>系统化探索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败诊断</td>\n<td>原始用例</td>\n<td>自动 shrink 到最小反例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>随逻辑变化需更新具体值</td>\n<td>性质通常更稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>具体业务规则</td>\n<td>通用不变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性质的分类与发现\">性质的分类与发现</h2><p>编写 property-based test 的核心挑战是「性质从哪来」。以下分类帮助系统化地发现性质：</p>\n<p><strong>代数性质</strong>：基于数据类型或操作的数学结构</p>\n<ul>\n<li>幂等性：<code>sort(sort(xs)) == sort(xs)</code></li>\n<li>交换性：<code>merge(a, b) == merge(b, a)</code></li>\n<li>结合性：<code>concat(concat(a, b), c) == concat(a, concat(b, c))</code></li>\n<li>分配性：<code>map f (xs ++ ys) == map f xs ++ map f ys</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>往返性质（Round-trip）</strong>：encode/decode、serialize/deserialize</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>decode(encode(x)) == x</code></li>\n<li><code>parse(format(date)) == date</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不变量</strong>：操作前后某些度量不变</p>\n<ul>\n<li>排序不改变长度：<code>length(sort(xs)) == length(xs)</code></li>\n<li>排序不改变元素集合：<code>Set.from(sort(xs)) == Set.from(xs)</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>相对性质（Test Oracle）</strong>：与已知正确实现对比</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新优化版本 vs 朴素正确版本产出相同结果</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// fast-check (TypeScript PBT 库)&#10;import fc from &#39;fast-check&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 性质 1：排序后的数组是有序的&#10;fc.assert(&#10;  fc.property(fc.array(fc.integer()), (arr) =&gt; {&#10;    const sorted = sort(arr);&#10;    return sorted.every((v, i) =&gt; i === 0 || sorted[i - 1] &lt;= v);&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 性质 2：排序是幂等的&#10;fc.assert(&#10;  fc.property(fc.array(fc.integer()), (arr) =&gt; {&#10;    const sorted = sort(arr);&#10;    return JSON.stringify(sort(sorted)) === JSON.stringify(sorted);&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 性质 3：JSON round-trip&#10;fc.assert(&#10;  fc.property(fc.jsonValue(), (value) =&gt; {&#10;    return JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value))) === JSON.stringify(value);&#10;  }),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// fast-check (TypeScript PBT 库)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fast-check'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 性质 1：排序后的数组是有序的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(arr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sorted.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sorted[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 性质 2：排序是幂等的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(arr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sorted)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sorted);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 性质 3：JSON round-trip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jsonValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value))) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"shrinking-找到最小反例\">Shrinking：找到最小反例</h2><p>当随机测试发现一个失败输入时，原始输入通常很大且充满噪音。Shrinking（缩减）自动将失败输入简化为仍然触发失败的<strong>最小</strong>输入，极大提升调试效率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 发现失败：[42, -7, 103, 0, -2, 55, 17] 导致排序错误&#10;// Shrinking 过程：&#10;// [42, -7, 103, 0, -2, 55, 17]  → 失败&#10;// [42, -7, 103]                  → 失败&#10;// [-7, 103]                      → 失败&#10;// [-7, 1]                        → 失败&#10;// [-1, 1]                        → 失败  ← 最小反例！\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 发现失败：[42, -7, 103, 0, -2, 55, 17] 导致排序错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Shrinking 过程：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [42, -7, 103, 0, -2, 55, 17]  → 失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [42, -7, 103]                  → 失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [-7, 103]                      → 失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [-7, 1]                        → 失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [-1, 1]                        → 失败  ← 最小反例！</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生成器组合\">生成器组合</h2><p>PBT 框架提供可组合的生成器（Generator），让你为复杂领域对象构造随机值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 组合生成器构建领域对象&#10;const genAddress = fc.record({&#10;  street: fc.string({ minLength: 1, maxLength: 50 }),&#10;  city: fc.string({ minLength: 1, maxLength: 30 }),&#10;  zip: fc.stringOf(&#10;    fc.char().filter((c) =&gt; /\\d/.test(c)),&#10;    { minLength: 5, maxLength: 5 },&#10;  ),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const genUser = fc.record({&#10;  id: fc.uuid(),&#10;  name: fc.string({ minLength: 1 }),&#10;  email: fc.emailAddress(),&#10;  address: genAddress,&#10;  createdAt: fc.date({ min: new Date(&#39;2020-01-01&#39;) }),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 组合生成器构建领域对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> genAddress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  street: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ minLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  city: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ minLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  zip: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { minLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> genUser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uuid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ minLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  email: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">emailAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  address: genAddress,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  createdAt: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ min: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2020-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"主流-pbt-框架\">主流 PBT 框架</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td>QuickCheck</td>\n<td>鼻祖，1999 年发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td>Hedgehog</td>\n<td>集成 shrinking，无需手写 Arbitrary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript/JS</td>\n<td>fast-check</td>\n<td>完整类型支持，集成 shrink</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scala</td>\n<td>ScalaCheck</td>\n<td>QuickCheck 移植，与 ScalaTest 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>proptest</td>\n<td>受 Hypothesis 启发，强 shrinking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>Hypothesis</td>\n<td>最成熟的 Python PBT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin</td>\n<td>Kotest Property</td>\n<td>与 Kotest 框架集成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"函数式测试策略的完整图谱\">函数式测试策略的完整图谱</h2><p>Property-Based Testing 不是孤立的——它与其他测试策略组合使用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>单元测试（Example-Based）</strong>：验证具体业务规则的边界用例</li>\n<li><strong>Property-Based Testing</strong>：验证通用不变量，发现遗漏的边界</li>\n<li><strong>集成测试</strong>：验证组件间的契约（contract testing）</li>\n<li><strong>变异测试（Mutation Testing）</strong>：验证测试套件本身的质量</li>\n</ol>\n<p>纯函数天然适合测试——无需 mock、无需 setup/teardown、无需控制执行顺序。函数式架构（Functional Core / Imperative Shell）将绝大部分逻辑放在纯函数中，让测试变得几乎trivial。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PBT 声明性质而非具体用例，框架自动生成大量随机输入</li>\n<li>性质来源：代数性质、往返、不变量、Test Oracle</li>\n<li>Shrinking 自动将失败输入缩减为最小反例</li>\n<li>生成器可组合，为复杂领域对象构造随机值</li>\n<li>纯函数 + PBT 是测试 ROI 最高的组合</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/pure-functions-immutability\">纯函数与不可变性</a> — 引用透明如何使 PBT 成为可能</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../haskell-pure-functional/practice/ecosystem-tooling\">Haskell hub：生态工具</a> — QuickCheck 在 Haskell 生态中的实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Property-Based Testing 与函数式测试策略","id":"property-based-testing-与函数式测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Example-Based 到 Property-Based","id":"从-example-based-到-property-based"},{"level":2,"text":"性质的分类与发现","id":"性质的分类与发现"},{"level":2,"text":"Shrinking：找到最小反例","id":"shrinking-找到最小反例"},{"level":2,"text":"生成器组合","id":"生成器组合"},{"level":2,"text":"主流 PBT 框架","id":"主流-pbt-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"函数式测试策略的完整图谱","id":"函数式测试策略的完整图谱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"主流语言中的函数式编程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/practice/fp-in-mainstream-languages"},"next":{"title":"函数式编程的性能工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/practice/performance-engineering"}}